  "description": "A gothic, low-light visual reskin for the toolkit, paired with the Horror Campaigns setting expansion (see fates-edge-docs/ttrpg/reference/expansions/horror_campaigns.tex) and the full Horror module package (fates-edge-docs/ttrpg/reference/expansions/horror-module/), which bundles this same theme with Thornhaven/Worn case data for the web client and a ready-to-push socket-server adventure ('The Ninth Bell'). Distinct from the Modern Noir theme's cyan cyberpunk palette — this one leans blood-red, bone, and candlelight amber, with a vignette instead of neon glow.",
